[{"i":"2011259242769575937","no":1,"t":2,"s":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">参考第二大题的实际操作题，回答下列问题。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1. 以下机构在直升机模型中出现的有哪些？（ ）</span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">顶部旋翼</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">尾浆</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">棘轮</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">凸轮</span></p>"}],"a":"A,B","an":"<p><br></p>","sc":4.0,"kp":[]},{"i":"2011259347178385410","no":2,"t":2,"s":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">下列关于直升机尾浆说法正确的有哪些？（ ）</span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">当尾浆失灵时，直升机会自旋</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">起到美观的作用</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">起到平衡的作用</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">没有任何作用</span></p>"}],"a":"A,C","an":"<p><br></p>","sc":4.0,"kp":[]},{"i":"2011259440572952577","no":3,"t":2,"s":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">下列关于电动机的说法正确的有哪些？（ ）</span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">使用电动机要给它通电</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">使用电动机不需给它通电</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电动机是用来发电的</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电动机将电能转化为机械能</span></p>"}],"a":"A,D","an":"<p><br></p>","sc":4.0,"kp":[]},{"i":"2011259548953767938","no":4,"t":2,"s":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">关于齿轮说法正确的有哪些？（ ）</span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">垂直啮合的两个齿轮旋转轴相互平行</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">垂直啮合的两个齿轮旋转轴相互平行</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">平行啮合的两个齿轮旋转轴相互平行</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">平行啮合的两个齿轮转向相反</span></p>"}],"a":"B,C,D","an":"<p><br></p>","sc":4.0,"kp":[]},{"i":"2011260023908364289","no":5,"t":4,"s":"<p><strong>实际操作(共1题，共80分)</strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">搭建说明:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">请考生制作一个电动直升机模型。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">搭建要求:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(a) 具备电动直升机模型大体框架；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(b) 采用垂直啮合的齿轮传动；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(c) 具备表示顶部旋翼，尾浆等的部件；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(d) 开启电动机，顶部旋翼可以旋转；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(e) 整体动作流畅。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">评分项：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1. 整体框架（40分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(1) 作品零件结构和样例模型基本一致，结构完整；（20分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(2) 作品相应部件固定可靠；（10分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(3) 作品整体协调美观。（10分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2. 动力传递/表现形式（30分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(1) 完整实现题目要求的动作；（15分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(2) 作品整体动作顺利流畅。（15分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3. 完成时间（10分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">器材说明:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">考生作答时不指定任何器材，所搭建的模型在外形、结构、功能方面满足题目要求即可。以下样例模型选自经中国电子学会评审通过的青少年机器人技术等级考试一级、二级适用器材。仅供参考，不作为考试评分的唯一依据。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">案例样图:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以下列举了相关器材模型样例，考生可任选其一作为参考。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样例1</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2026-01-14/8699600830871068672.jpg\" alt=\"样例1.jpg\" data-href=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2026-01-14/8699600830871068672.jpg\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样例2</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2026-01-14/8699600861221036032.jpg\" alt=\"样例2.jpg\" data-href=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2026-01-14/8699600861221036032.jpg\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样例3</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2026-01-14/8699600884793024512.jpg\" alt=\"样例3.jpg\" data-href=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2026-01-14/8699600884793024512.jpg\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样例4</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2026-01-14/8699600914287386624.jpg\" alt=\"样例4.jpg\" data-href=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2026-01-14/8699600914287386624.jpg\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样例5</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2026-01-14/8699600946378006528.jpg\" alt=\"样例5.jpg\" data-href=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2026-01-14/8699600946378006528.jpg\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样例6</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2026-01-14/8699600968461000704.jpg\" alt=\"样例6.jpg\" data-href=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2026-01-14/8699600968461000704.jpg\" style=\"\"></p>","o":[],"a":"","an":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、评分说明</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1. 整体框架（40分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(1) 作品零件结构是否和样例模型基本一致、结构完整，具备①电动机、②顶部旋翼、③尾浆、④垂直啮合的齿轮，以上每缺少一点扣10分，缺少两点及两点以上扣20分；（20分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(2) 作品相应部件的固定可靠程度；（10分） </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(3) 作品的整体协调性和美观性。（10分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2. 动力传递/表现形式（30分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(1) 启动电动机，顶部旋翼旋转；（15分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(2) 作品整体动作顺利流畅。（15分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3. 完成时间（10分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在考试时间内完成得10分，超时1分钟扣1分。（10分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">超时10分钟以上不结束操作总成绩记为0分。</span></p>","sc":80.0,"kp":[]}]